## is 90 percent a fact about the corpus or about the selection
Almost certainly the selection: the rows here were chosen as the
instruments a live claim needs plus every instrument whose defect the
corpus records, and both populations are files whose authors were
paying attention. Checked rather than assumed, by splitting p4 own
per-file classification on whether the directory has a row here.

not_represented   282 of  941 state a control  (30.0%)
represented       144 of  192 state a control  (75.0%)

